  "description": "Operating Area: Greek Islands\n\nM/Y KOKOMO NIGHTS is a 47m classic Italian motor yacht built by Picchiotti, combining timeless elegance with exceptional seakeeping performance. Her warm, refined interiors and spacious exterior decks - highlighted by a panoramic sundeck jacuzzi - create the perfect setting for relaxed luxury cruising. Equipped with zero-speed stabilizers and supported by a professional crew, she offers a smooth, comfortable, and truly memorable yachting experience. Designed for both intimate family charters and sophisticated gatherings, she provides generous social areas and a practical, cozy layout. Guests can enjoy gourmet cuisine on deck, breathtaking sunset views, and effortless days at sea in complete comfort.\n",
